   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div>I&#39;m currently developing an Shiny App which connects to an Oracle Database in the company I work at. </div><div>The app is working like a charm locally, however when I try to deploy it through ShinyApp.io it starts by installing all the packages and when it gets to <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ROracle/ROracle.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ROracle/ROracle.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362659629000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1HLcPtefeCMNKxJk3vluxj\">ROracle </a>package it returns the following error:<br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2015</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">08T10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">43</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">41.675492602</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Building</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> R </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">ROracle</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mnt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">build </span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mnt<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> installing to library </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">usr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#008\">local</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lib</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">site</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> installing </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘</span><span style=\"color:#606\">ROracle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">**</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘</span><span style=\"color:#606\">ROracle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> successfully unpacked </span><span style=\"color:#008\">and</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> MD5 sums </span><span style=\"color:#008\">checked</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>configure</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> OCI libraries </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> found<br>ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> configuration failed </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘</span><span style=\"color:#606\">ROracle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> removing </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">usr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#008\">local</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lib</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">site</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#606\">ROracle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">################################# End Task Log ################################# Error: Unhandled Exception: Child Task 88404593 failed: Error building image: Error building ROracle (1.2-1). Build exited with non-zero status: 1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m running the following code to Deploy:</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">shinyapps</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">deployApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;C://Users/oracle/Documents/repo/repositório/Produtos/Shiny&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><b>Anyone had this problem before or used  ROracle in a Shiny App ?</b></div><div><br>Any other code snippets that would help solving it please ask and I&#39;ll post it.</div><div>Thanks in advance!</div><div><br></div></div>"
